taient) témoins ?","37:151:1":"Sans doute,","37:151:2":"certes, eux","37:151:3":"à cause de","37:151:4":"leur mensonge maléfique","37:151:5":"disent certainement :","37:152:1":"« A donné naissance","37:152:2":"Allâh. »","37:152:3":"alors que certes ils (sont)","37:152:4":"certainement des menteurs !","37:153:1":"Est-ce qu’il a élu","37:153:2":"les filles","37:153:3":"(de préférence) aux","37:153:4":"fils ?","37:154:1":"Qu’est-ce qu’","37:154:2":"(il y a) à vous ?","37:154:3":"Comment","37:154:4":"Jugez-vous ?","37:155:1":"Donc est-ce que ne pas","37:155:2":"vous vous rappellerez ?","37:156:1":"Ou est-ce qu’","37:156:2":"(il y a) à vous","37:156:3":"une preuve autoritaire","37:156:4":"claire ?","37:157:1":"« Amenez alors","37:157:2":"[] votre livre","37:157:3":"si","37:157:4":"vous êtes","37:157:5":"véridiques !","37:158:1":"Et ils ont fait","37:158:2":"entre Lui","37:158:3":"et [entre]","37:158:4":"les djinns","37:158:5":"une relation.","37:158:6":"Et très certainement","37:158:7":"ont su","37:158:8":"les djinns","37:158:9":"qu’ils (seront)","37:158:10":"certainement rendus présents.","37:159:1":"(Est déclarée La) Perfection","37:159:2":"(d’)Allâh","37:159:3":"au-dessus de ce qu’","37:159:4":"ils décrivent !","37:160:1":"Sauf","37:160:2":"(les) esclaves","37:160:3":"(d’)Allâh","37:160:4":"élus.","37:161:1":"Donc certes, vous","37:161:2":"et ce que","37:161:3":"vous adorez,","37:162:1":"ne pas","37:162:2":"vous (serez)","37:162:3":"avec lui","37:162:4":"du tout des gens qui mettent en grande épreuve","37:163:1":"sauf","37:163:2":"quiconque","37:163:3":"(sera) lui","37:163:4":"quelqu’un qui brûle","37:163:5":"(dans) Le Feu Ardent.","37:164:1":"« Et (il n’y a) pas","37:164:2":"parmi nous","37:164:3":"(qui que ce soit) sans qu’","37:164:4":"(il y ait) pour lui","37:164:5":"une position","37:164:6":"connue.","37:165:1":"Et certes, nous","37:165:2":"(sommes) certainement nous","37:165:3":"ceux alignés en rangs.","37:166:1":"Et certes, nous","37:166:2":"(sommes) certainement nous","37:166:3":"ceux qui déclarent La Perfection d’Allâh ! »","37:167:1":"Et certes,","37:167:2":"ils disaient","37:167:3":"ils disaient :","37:168:1":"« S’","37:168:2":"[qu’](il y avait)","37:168:3":"auprès (de) nous","37:168:4":"un rappel","37:168:5":"des","37:168:6":"[les] (gens) premiers,","37:169:1":"nous aurions certainement été","37:169:2":"(les) esclaves","37:169:3":"(d’)Allâh","37:169:4":"élus ! »","37:170:1":"Et ils ont ensuite mécru","37:170:2":"en Lui.","37:170:3":"Bientôt donc","37:170:4":"ils sauront.","37:171:1":"Et très certainement","37:171:2":"a précédé","37:171:3":"Notre Parole","37:171:4":"pour Nos esclaves","37:171:5":"Messagers.","37:172:1":"Certes, ils (sont)","37:172:2":"certainement eux","37:172:3":"ceux qui sont aidés contre les ennemis.","37:173:1":"Et certes,","37:173:2":"Nos soldats (sont)","37:173:3":"certainement eux","37:173:4":"ceux qui surpassent.","37:174:1":"Détourné-toi donc","37:174:2":"d’eux","37:174:3":"jusqu’à","37:174:4":"un moment.","37:175:1":"Et vois-les","37:175:2":"et ensuite bientôt","37:175:3":"ils verront.","37:176:1":"Est-ce que [à] notre châtiment donc","37:176:2":"ils cherchent à hâter ?","37:177:1":"Alors quand","37:177:2":"il descendra","37:177:3":"dans leur terrain libre,","37:177:4":"alors sera mauvaise","37:177:5":"(l’)aube","37:177:6":"(de) ceux qui ont été avertis !","37:178:1":"Et détourné-toi","37:178:2":"d’eux","37:178:3":"jusqu’à","37:178:4":"un moment.","37:179:1":"Et vois","37:179:2":"et ensuite bientôt","37:179:3":"ils verront.","37:180:1":"(Est déclarée La) Perfection","37:180:2":"(de) ton Maître,","37:180:3":"(Le) Maître","37:180:4":"(de) La Force,","37:180:5":"au-dessus (de) ce qu’","37:180:6":"ils décrivent !","37:181:1":"Et paix","37:181:2":"sur","37:181:3":"Les Messagers.","37:182:1":"Et tous les compliments","37:182:2":"(appartiennent) à Allâh,","37:182:3":"(Le) Maître","37:182:4":"(de) toutes les générations de chaque créature."}
